After clearing sokoban, it was time to head upwards and b/u/c
everything at one of the many altars higher up.  Grimley got lucky with
a b?identify (full-pack-ID).  One of his dwarvish short swords came up
+2, so it was time to start two-weaponing.

Before hiting the mines-entrance, Grimley found a large armour shop.
Inside it were a cloak of invisibility, water walking boots, and a
Hawaiian shirt.  While shopping, a mimic death-dropped a blessed magic
lamp.  Wish #1 was spent on the Magic Mirror of Merlin.

The minetown temple was cross-aligned (grr ...) but as compensation
Izchak had a third magic lamp.  After cleaning all the useful stuff out
of the stores, it was time to head downwards.

**** {leaving Minetown}
